{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32672","headline":"留别崔澣秀才昆仲 · 刘沧","name":"留别崔澣秀才昆仲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汶阳离思水无穷，去住情深梦寐中。\n岁晚虫鸣寒露草，日西蝉噪古槐风。\n川分远岳秋光静，云尽遥天霁色空。\n对酒不能伤此别，尺书凭鴈往来通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}